    "ch_4": {
      "type": "sy-chapter",
      "settings": {
        "number": "IV",
        "label": "Honestly described",
        "lead": true,
        "media_layout": "none",
        "text": "<p>Not everything here is perfect. Nor should it be.</p><p>Some pieces have pedigrees and recognizable makers. Others are unsigned mysteries. Some are remarkably preserved; others show every bit of the life they've already lived. I describe condition honestly, but I don't believe age itself is a flaw.</p>",
        "padding_top": 120,
        "padding_bottom": 56
      }
    },
    "ch_5": {
      "type": "sy-chapter",
      "settings": {
        "number": "V",
        "label": "Why it exists",
        "lead": true,
        "media_layout": "none",
        "text": "<p>Eventually I faced a practical problem: I couldn't possibly keep everything I wanted to bring home.</p><p>And that became Subjectively Yours.</p><p>I visit antique shops, estate sales, flea markets and unexpected places, and sift through all of it. What ends up here has passed through a very subjective filter — my eye, my experiences, the places I've lived and travelled, the things I've read, the homes I've made, and all the other influences that somehow become taste.</p><p>You don't have to spend your weekends digging through a hundred things to find the one.</p><p>That's my part.</p>",
        "padding_top": 56,
        "padding_bottom": 120
      }
    },
